@oracle-en1992-1-compliance-independent
@comparison-numerical-v1
Feature: EN 1992 check outcome of committed documents
  A committed before- or after-snapshot of the mutation fixtures is evaluated by the production report and by an independent strain-compatibility and Annex B formulation of `../../🔮️oracles/🚦️check-outcome/🐍️.py` (flexure, shear, crack width, elastic steel and concrete stresses of the characteristic combination, span-to-depth and deflection of the reinforced concrete members, punching shear, its crushing limit and the stud layout of flat slabs (control perimeters and ring perimeters by shapely), the stress limits of 5.10.2 and the decompression of 7.3.1 of prestressed members whose tendon is resolved from its control points; compression positive, a fibre the prestress alone puts in tension is measured against the mean prestress).
  Each row names one check id (a family id reports the worst row of every combination), its status (pass at a utilisation of at most 1, fail above 1) and its utilisation; rows were picked away from the near-limit band so the status is unambiguous.

